  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  Widows can project is a project is being implemented in informal settlements of Nairobi Kenya.  Namely; Kibera, Dandora, Mathare and muru Kwa njenga. The project builds on the social empowerment processes initiated under that seeks to adopt an integrated approach in the four informal settlement to strengthen simultaneously all the key dimensions of widows&apos; empowerment - social, economic and leadership.  Diversify economic opportunities and choices that lead to sustainable increase in HHs.</narrative>
  </description>
